The limit is 5.
The ways is a list of 33 zeros.
Set item 0 of ways to 1.
Set item 1 of ways to 2.
For every spot from 2 to 32.
The prior is item (spot minus 1) of ways.
The earlier is item (spot minus 2) of ways.
Set item spot of ways to prior plus earlier.

The top is 0.
The probe is limit.
Repeat while probe is more than 0.
Set probe to probe divided by 2.
Add 1 to top.

The answer is 0.
The before is 0.
The blocked is 0.
For every step from 1 to top.
The position is top minus step.
The raised is shift 1 left by position.
The bit is bitwise and of limit and raised.
If bit is more than 0, set answer to answer plus item position of ways.
If bit is more than 0 and before is 1, set blocked to 1.
If bit is more than 0, set before to 1.
If bit is 0, set before to 0.
If blocked is 1, stop.

If blocked is 0, add 1 to answer.
Show answer.
